OL,3,GNEWSAWhat library services could be cut
OL,4,Aand why are people 'horrified' by it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor authors like Tracey J Morgan from
OL,7,FShrewsbury, the thought of limiting
OL,8,Fpeople's access to books is a
OL,9,Fhorrifying one.
OL,11,F"Libraries are literally the heartbeat
OL,12,Fof the community," she said in response
OL,13,Fto Shropshire Council's proposal to cut
OL,14,Fback on the library services it
OL,15,Fprovides.
OL,17,FMorgan is equally concerned about the
OL,18,Fwider impact that it could have on
OL,19,Fsociety, from communities losing warm
OL,20,Fspaces during cold winter months to
OL,21,Fclubs and groups having to find new
OL,22,Fhomes.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
