OL,3,GNEWSAWhat library services could be cut
OL,4,Aand why are people 'horrified' by it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCutting library services is not a
OL,7,Fdecision the Liberal Democrats running
OL,8,FShropshire Council want to make, but
OL,9,Fthe authority is under growing pressure
OL,10,Ffrom government to demonstrate its
OL,11,Fseriousness about finding urgent
OL,12,Fsavings.
